1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Meet Opportunities, your private editorial companion inside Ghost.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,556
Connect using your server address, Ghost site, and

3
00:00:07,556 --> 00:00:08,444
editor token.

4
00:00:08,444 --> 00:00:12,000
Airtable and Ghost credentials stay on the server.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,222
Review the latest eight opportunities.

6
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:17,778
Search, filter, check sources, approve, reject, or reopen

7
00:00:17,778 --> 00:00:20,000
an item for another review.

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Edit titles, descriptions, deadlines, categories, and links, then

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
save your changes back to Airtable.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,368
Add approved opportunities to a draft, preserving existing

11
00:00:30,368 --> 00:00:30,789
content.

12
00:00:30,789 --> 00:00:34,158
Approvals can also sync automatically to a configured

13
00:00:34,158 --> 00:00:35,000
Ghost page.

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,167
Need a replacement?

15
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:38,111
Swap in another approved opportunity.

16
00:00:38,111 --> 00:00:39,667
Only that card changes;

17
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:42,000
your other editorial content stays intact.

18
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,824
Type reject Globex, review the proposed action, and

19
00:00:44,824 --> 00:00:45,176
confirm.

20
00:00:45,176 --> 00:00:48,000
These are simple commands, not full AI chat.

21
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The activity feed tracks changes.

22
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,200
Refresh for updates, collapse the panel, or disconnect

23
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,000
your session.

24
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Extension, server, Airtable and Ghost.

25
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
This demo uses sample data.

26
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Live connections need your credentials.
